nagement","s":"William Chalmers","x":"So, to move on and look at below the line on Slide 4, the restructuring charges continue to reduce, were down 54% over the last year while the MBNA integration, ringfencing work are now complete.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/lloyds-banking-group-lyg-q3-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"LYG 2019 Q4","e":"lyg","d":"2020-02-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Chalmers","x":"Focusing on restructuring for a moment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/20/lloyds-bank-group-plc-lyg-q4-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"LYG 2019 Q4","e":"lyg","d":"2020-02-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Chalmers","x":"Looking forward in 2020, we expect restructuring to be somewhat higher as we continue to transform the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/20/lloyds-bank-group-plc-lyg-q4-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"LYG 2019 Q4","e":"lyg","d":"2020-02-20","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Chris Cant","x":"You've cut the guidance for 2020 to 12% to 13% and I understand you're still adding back the amortization costs within that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/20/lloyds-bank-group-plc-lyg-q4-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"LYG 2020 Q3","e":"lyg","d":"2020-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Andrew Coombs","x":"In the discussions you have with the Bank of England, it's been quite interesting in the dynamics this year, in that really the mortgage rates have been a function of supply and demand, whereas in the past we've really seen the pass-through of lower rates on to the mortgage market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/lloyds-banking-group-plc-adr-lyg-q3-2020-earnings/"},{"c":"LYG 2020 Q3","e":"lyg","d":"2020-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Andrew Coombs","x":"…here that in the discussions you have with the Bank of England, when they are talking about the prospect of further rate cuts potentially moving to negative rates, what we've seen this year is that hasn't passed through to the mortgage market and hasn't passed through to the end consumer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/lloyds-banking-group-plc-adr-lyg-q3-2020-earnings/"},{"c":"LYG 2020 Q3","e":"lyg","d":"2020-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Chalmers","x":"This has been achieved despite deferring all corona based restructuring activity, for a number of months this year, resulting in higher than expected average headcount, albeit with lower bonus accruals.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/lloyds-banking-group-plc-adr-lyg-q3-2020-earnings/"},{"c":"LYG 2020 Q3","e":"lyg","d":"2020-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Chalmers","x":"Our current record of ongoing sustainable cost savings has enabled continued investment in the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/lloyds-banking-group-plc-adr-lyg-q3-2020-earnings/"},{"c":"LYG 2020 Q4","e":"lyg","d":"2021-02-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Antonio Horta-Osorio","x":"In this period, we have successfully shifted our focus from one of restructuring to one of selective growth and investments. #execution in this period has created clear competitive advantages.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/24/lloyds-bank-group-plc-lyg-q4-2020-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"LYG 2020 Q4","e":"lyg","d":"2021-02-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Chalmers","x":"We expect to be able to fully absorb these headwinds through our ongoing cost reduction activity and for our operating costs to continue to fall to circa GBP7.5 billion this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/24/lloyds-bank-group-plc-lyg-q4-2020-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"LYG 2021 Q1","e":"lyg","d":"2021-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Chalmers","x":"In commercial, we've seen a release in the quarter given improved outcomes on restructuring cases, lower defaults and reduced balance sheet exposures.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/lloyds-banking-group-plc-adr-lyg-q1-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"LYG 2021 Q1","e":"lyg","d":"2021-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Chalmers","x":"Restructuring costs in Q1 were up year-on-year, largely driven by increased severance costs and R&D technology costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/lloyds-banking-group-plc-adr-lyg-q1-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"LYG 2021 Q2","e":"lyg","d":"2021-07-30","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"William Chalmers","x":"Embark's existing business and technology capabilities, will enable the group to deliver a modern, leading direct-to-consumer proposition.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/31/lloyds-banking-group-plc-lyg-q2-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"LYG 2021 Q2","e":"lyg","d":"2021-07-30","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"William Chalmers","x":"And what I mean by that is it gives us a direct-to-consumer capability on what is a modern platform for a spectrum of consumer savings products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/31/lloyds-banking-group-plc-lyg-q2-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"LYG 2021 Q2","e":"lyg","d":"2021-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"William Chalmers","x":"We've also seen limited credit migration to date, in part due to the impact of house price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/31/lloyds-banking-group-plc-lyg-q2-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"LYG 2021 Q2","e":"lyg","d":"2021-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Chalmers","x":"We're targeting a mid-teens return on invested capital in the medium term, including all integration and restructuring costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/31/lloyds-banking-group-plc-lyg-q2-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"LYG 2021 Q2","e":"lyg","d":"2021-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Chalmers","x":"In this context, commercial banking has also benefited from improved restructuring outcomes and lower balances.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/31/lloyds-banking-group-plc-lyg-q2-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"LYG 2026 Q2","e":"lyg","d":"2026-07-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Charles Nunn","x":"Investments in our people, data and AI are the cornerstones of this and are critical to enabling our growth ambitions and a productivity step change.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/lloyds-lyg-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LYG 2026 Q2","e":"lyg","d":"2026-07-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Charles Nunn","x":"We'll also increase customer access to advice through agentic AI-enabled offering, Invest AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/lloyds-lyg-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LYG 2026 Q2","e":"lyg","d":"2026-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"William Leon Chalmers","x":"But I think when we look at the prospect of M&A, we pass it through a number of filters, just as Charlie said, strategic adherence is clear baseline.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/lloyds-lyg-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LYG 2026 Q2","e":"lyg","d":"2026-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Charles Nunn","x":"We've now realized more than GBP 2 billion of gross cost savings since 2021, having surpassed our original targets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/lloyds-lyg-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LYG 2026 Q2","e":"lyg","d":"2026-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Leon Chalmers","x":"This reflects continued efficiency savings, some timing impacts and slightly lower i